### B.Tech Backend Development Fundamentals - Lab 02
### API Test Requests (REST Client / Postman format)
### Base URL: http://localhost:3000

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 0. Health / Root Route
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Accept: application/json

### 1. GET /books/ - Retrieve All Books
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/
Accept: application/json

### 2. GET /books/:bookId/ - Retrieve Single Book (Success Case)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/1/
Accept: application/json

### 2b. GET /books/:bookId/ - Retrieve Single Book (404 Not Found Edge Case)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/999/
Accept: application/json

### 3. POST /books/ - Add a New Book
POST {{baseUrl}}/books/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Computer Networks: A Systems Approach",
  "author": "Larry L. Peterson & Bruce S. Davie",
  "price": 849,
  "pages": 920
}

### 4. PUT /books/:bookId/ - Update an Existing Book
PUT {{baseUrl}}/books/1/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Clean Code: A Handbook of Agile Software Craftsmanship",
  "author": "Robert C. Martin (Uncle Bob)",
  "price": 699,
  "pages": 464
}

### 5. DELETE /books/:bookId/ - Delete a Book
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/books/11/
Accept: application/json
